          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yesu yaabakoba ati: “Bwenebwene ka mbakobere mu kiseera eky'okwiza byonabyona obuyaaka, ng'Omwana w'Omuntu atyaime ku kityamo kye eky'ekitiisa, imwe abaanonereza mwena mulityama ku bityamo ikumi n'abiri mwafuga ebika eikumi n'ebibiri ebya Isiraeli.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.19.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.19.28"
            ]
          }
        },
